# Nicole Njeri Nduta — Personal Portfolio

A responsive personal portfolio homepage created for **CSN 1101: Web Technologies and Internet Applications** at KCA University.

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates:
- Semantic HTML5 structure
- External CSS styling
- Responsive design for mobile and desktop screens
- A personal hero section with a profile photo
- About Me, Projects, and Contact sections
- Accessible navigation and image alternative text

## Files

- `index.html` — main portfolio page
- `style.css` — external stylesheet
- `profile.jpg` — profile photo

## Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Responsive design with media queries

